Meta:
	Version	1
	
	Lang	ja
	Title	恋符「ノンディレクショナルレーザー」
	Desc	ゲージ上昇UP <#c:00f>(140%)
	Desc	SLIDE/HOLD成功時に
	Desc	ボーナス <#c:00f>+120
	
	Lang	en
	Title	Love Sign "Non-Directional Laser"
	Desc	Increments the gauge increase rate to
	Desc	<#c:00f>140%<#r>.
	Desc	Bonus <#c:00f>+120<#r> for SLIDE / HOLD notes.
	
	Attr	BTarget
	Indicator	INBoost
	CountDef	200
	
	TargetChara	touhou/001/0

OnJudge:
	If	Answer	!=	M
		Boost	INBoost	Mul	1.4
	ClearIf

	If	Counter	>	0
	If	Answer	=	JC	J
	If	NoteCat	=	CHold	CSlide
		Counter	-1
		Boost	INBoost	Add	120
	ClearIf
	